# The working tree is Windows (core.autocrlf=true) but the deploy target
# is a Linux Pi, so git stores and checks out LF everywhere. This matches
# Prettier's endOfLine: "lf" in .prettierrc, and is the setup Prettier's
# own documentation prescribes for a repo that should contain only LF.
#
# CLAUDE.md scheduled this file "before committing the first shell script";
# adding the formatter brought the same decision forward.

* text=auto eol=lf
